{"title":"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Each_Value_of_X)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Each Value of X)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Modular_Arithmetic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Modular Arithmetic)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A palindrome is a positive integer whose digits are the same when read forwards or backwards. For example, 32 523 is a palindrome. How many palindromes greater than 10 000 and less than 100 000 are multiples of 18?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/2743fb6b6886539b343d23ac5d21d3b190542933.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 41 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 42 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 43 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 44 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Each_Value_of_X.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Each_Value_of_X)\">Solution 1 (Each Value of X)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Each Value of X)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the number is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/499a5ed21b91860cdece2254f6200e3cdeddfce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" /> but less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/749e167e8cafea9850b4f6d25ab1110e86807fe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> and is a palindrome, it must be a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82dae56b405b0ca36af28d3491e8840cae4b054.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{XYZYX}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead47fb9fb4a4c273feee398f72ff2a09702b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> are not necessarily distinct digits.\n</p><p>For a number to be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, it must be divisible by both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because it is also in the first and last digit), and the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82dae56b405b0ca36af28d3491e8840cae4b054.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{XYZYX}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/6/bf695a6c5165f10b7c17b42767f320338ea98594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2X + 2Y + Z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"16\" />, must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b40e7d4544af3b77393f8b7a3cc52e9d46d64185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de0e725bed488104e26e4da206c00e86bf949dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/145715f9a08921e63a539f4d89044dbb164ea32d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/145715f9a08921e63a539f4d89044dbb164ea32d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> can only go to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/2/142358544d23af558cf32eb6bcdefc981edbbab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 9 + 9 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead47fb9fb4a4c273feee398f72ff2a09702b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> are digits, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/423965941c53573b6b839fdca9b069d77cedee61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6eaa61b3138365d1ac4da86e0fd1eadadea9a5ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cd5888cecd0ceac560cf0d9c367c7f688b1dc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/423965941c53573b6b839fdca9b069d77cedee61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> can be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aae69d5a3cf3e7239ddd216b41562e0c55d903f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/7665cc4223d31e60fba93de9e8e901b3bd737b3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 3 = 6$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6eaa61b3138365d1ac4da86e0fd1eadadea9a5ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> can be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aaa87f27a7cbbb8ba8272909fbe613a0bc09234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 7 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aae69d5a3cf3e7239ddd216b41562e0c55d903f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> would make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead47fb9fb4a4c273feee398f72ff2a09702b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> too large to be a digit, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cd5888cecd0ceac560cf0d9c367c7f688b1dc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> can be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/34708f8c5906bb1bdc89f30ea8412e8b03ba1c53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 9 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> does not go over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c768058527b5b4d48df61c1a9147f1c5ddefb147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 6 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> would make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead47fb9fb4a4c273feee398f72ff2a09702b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> too large, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities. Thus, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b40e7d4544af3b77393f8b7a3cc52e9d46d64185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/518211c72f1486b47f298b052523053ddab5101f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 5 + 3 = 8 + 3 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b3019aa161a29f20e67e2a7660f20d82c8d2573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/9/179747d7296f8b695c5c58acbc1e26dff4775898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/145715f9a08921e63a539f4d89044dbb164ea32d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f04fb14b49643472fe64ba5d28c6025b0b6bf051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4051334b869002f3561727088c4d152adac54bee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a1e98d121f78e13c3bc37a6e300f36663932ccd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f04fb14b49643472fe64ba5d28c6025b0b6bf051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> would have to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97953b1d8db04d7782b7e60df41d23a0cb5e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> goes above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so there is only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibility. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4051334b869002f3561727088c4d152adac54bee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2Y + Z = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> can be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$